OL,3,AManhunt after shooting at Swiss rave
OL,4,Akills woman, 22, and injures five
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt a news conference on Sunday
OL,7,Fafternoon, police spokesman Bernhard
OL,8,FGraser reiterated the force had "no
OL,9,Finformation about the perpetrator(s) or
OL,10,Ftheir motive". They were not believed
OL,11,Fto be in Aarau anymore, he added.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
